flowchart LR
 O[Objective Model] --> C[Constraint Engine]
 P[Option Discovery] --> C
 X[Context + Evidence] --> C
 C --> H{Hard constraints}
 H -->|violated| B[Ineligible]
 H -->|unknown fail-closed| U[Blocked / needs resolution]
 H -->|satisfied| S[Soft constraint penalties]
 S --> E[Eligible option + explicit penalties]
 E --> R[Later prediction / comparison / ranking]
 R -. cannot bypass .-> G[Governed execution boundary]
